# 10. Missing Experience vs Missing Keywords

IMPORTANT:

Separate genuine **experience gaps** from simple **keyword gaps**.

### Keyword Gap

The resume may contain the experience but does not use the terminology from the job description.

Example:

Resume:

> Managed user permissions and access.

Job:

> Requires RBAC and IAM.

This may be a **keyword/terminology gap**, not necessarily an experience gap.

### Experience Gap

The resume genuinely does not demonstrate the required experience.

Example:

Job:

> 3+ years Kubernetes administration.

Resume:

> No Kubernetes experience mentioned.

This is an **experience gap**.

